<view class="page success-page" wx:if="{{order}}"><image class="success-art" src="/assets/illustrations/cloud-hero.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HAPPINESS IS ON ITS WAY</text><view class="title serif">小屋收下你的期待啦</view><view class="success-copy">模拟支付已完成 · {{modeName}}<text>每一份手作，都值得耐心等待。</text></view><view wx:if="{{order.pickupCode}}" class="pickup-code"><text>你的取餐码</text><view>{{order.pickupCode}}</view><text>到店后向店员出示 · 课程演示</text></view><view class="success-receipt"><view class="money-row"><text class="muted">实付金额</text><text class="price">¥{{totalText}}</text></view><button class="money-row order-number" bindtap="copy"><text class="muted">订单编号</text><text>{{order.number}} ⧉</text></button></view><button class="btn" bindtap="detail" hover-class="pressed">查看订单 →</button><button class="btn-outline" bindtap="home" hover-class="pressed">回小屋首页</button><view class="footer-note">课程演示 · 未发生真实支付</view></view>
